{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pulls/1647","id":5260517076,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVgdJU88AAAABOY0e1A","html_url":"https://github.com/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pull/1647","diff_url":"https://github.com/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pull/1647.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pull/1647.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/issues/1647","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pulls/1647/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pulls/1647/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/issues/1647/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/statuses/93d23b21dd1a725c67f21ac039ab64bafe800b18","number":1647,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Balance and lock a counterweighted service arm","user":{"login":"aryansennthilkumarGT","id":324683079,"node_id":"U_kgDOE1pFRw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/324683079?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT","html_url":"https://github.com/aryansennthilkumarGT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Task\n\nBalance and lock a counterweighted service arm. Support the loaded free pivot, slide its counterweight, insert a free locking pin through collision-defined holes, then withdraw both hands while the arm stays level.\n\n## Distinction\n\nThe counterweight setting changes the gravitational moment. The pin retains the translating mass and leaves the pivot free. NOVELTY.md compares the current board, including the rocker with an eccentric weight, pivot-clamped inspection arm, loose ballast tasks and pin-indexed rotary table. The required final state is passive intermediate-angle equilibrium with retained mass position.\n\n## Executed evidence\n\n- Native PhysX mechanism probes passed 8/8 across independent resets.\n- Real robot-control probes passed 4/4.\n- Two independently launched scripted expert episodes scored 1.0, each using 1899 actions of a 4800-action limit.\n- A clean HTTPS checkout reproduced expert score 1.0.\n- Dream-1 completed 4800 actions and scored 0.0. All three camera streams and scorer replay were verified.\n- Official uploaded media ID is M-NRTVLQ. The model video shows the genuine zero-score run and the demo shows a full-score expert. Videos are H.264 MP4 and the setup image is a native sensor capture.\n\n## Reproduction and fidelity\n\nREADME.md provides direct execution commands and measured runtimes. SETUP.md and scene.json specify the fixed layout, geometry, masses, center of mass, contact parameters and reset. SCORING.md gives numerical conditions and invalid outcomes. The payload is rigidly mounted, the counterweight guide uses a prismatic joint, and rigid chamfers approximate pin lead-ins.\n\nEvaluated simulation revision is `46bf1008e01546b266b5ba973d31e75e64bf8f89`. The publication commit updates documentation, measured evidence, official media metadata and the rollout validator for the installed Inspect Dream checkpoint schema. Simulation, controller, assets and scorer are byte-identical to the evaluated revision.\n\nFinal submission revision is `a50a9e905bb846ad4475ef85b7942180cc605bbb`.\n","labels":[{"id":12974807321,"node_id":"LA_kwDOVgdJU88AAAADBVvZGQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robocurve/benchmark-tasks/labels/Not%20accepted:%20final","name":"Not accepted: final","description":null,"color":"ededed","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-11T13:41:08Z","updated_at":"2026-11-12T11:57:34Z","closed_at":"2026-11-12T11:57:33Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"3a2d5f21b320c3fdf869f058be3b6e44a42dd940","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"aryansennthilkumarGT:draft/fault-module-repair","ref":"draft/fault-module-repair","repo":{"id":1447590552,"node_id":"R_kgDOVkh6mA","name":"benchmark-tasks","full_name":"aryansennthilkumarGT/benchmark-tasks","owner":{"login":"aryansennthilkumarGT","id":324683079,"node_id":"U_kgDOE1pFRw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/324683079?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT","html_url":"https://github.com/aryansennthilkumarGT","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aryansennthilkumarGT